  "nodes.warsztat.text": {"t":"Bogdan lays his hammer on the anvil and glances at the door. \"I don't forge swords. Mending other men's, that's another matter. The Emperor doesn't know, and let's keep it that way. What have you brought?\"","h":"9f83c7e6"},
